#: wp-admin-theme-cd.php:356
msgid ""
"RSS (Really Simple Syndication) is a type of web feed which allows users to "
"access updates to online content in a standardized, computer-readable format."
msgstr ""
"RSS（Really Simple Syndication）是一种Web订阅源，允许用户以标准化的计算机可读"
"格式访问在线内容的更新。"

#: wp-admin-theme-cd.php:360
msgid "Remove the RSD link from wp head."
msgstr "从wp head中删除RSD链接。"

#: wp-admin-theme-cd.php:361
msgid ""
"Really Simple Discovery (RSD) is an XML format and a publishing convention "
"for making services exposed by a blog, or other web software, discoverable "
"by client software."
msgstr ""
"真正简单发现（RSD）是一种XML格式和发布约定，用于通过客户端软件可发现的博客或"
"其他Web软件公开服务。"

#: wp-admin-theme-cd.php:365
#, fuzzy
